- asMap: boolean (optional) if true, return a Map keyed by keyFn(tuple) -> {tuple, count}.
- useD3: boolean (optional) if true forces attempting to use d3-array-utils (default true).
- includePositions: boolean (optional) include an array of start indices where the tuple occurs as record.positions.

Return value (default): array of records [{ tuple: [...], key: '...', count: n, positions: [...]? }, ...] sorted and limited per options. If asMap true, returns Map(key => record).

